hwlab FTDI / MPSSE / JTAG backend (plugins/ftdi)

Implemented independently in Go. No third-party source code is included.

References (specifications and hardware facts, not code):
  * FTDI AN_108 "Command Processor for MPSSE and MCU Host Bus Emulation Modes"
    and AN_135 "FTDI MPSSE Basics": public protocol documentation.
  * IEEE 1149.1 TAP state machine (public standard).
  * OpenOCD tcl/interface/ftdi/sipeed-rv-debugger.cfg (GPL-2.0): only the
    configuration values (VID:PID 0403:6010, channel 0, layout_init
    0x0008 0x001b, speed 6000 kHz) were read as hardware facts. No OpenOCD
    source is copied or linked; OpenOCD is not run by hwlab.
  * Sipeed RV-Debugger-BL702 firmware (Apache-2.0 headers): consulted as
    behavioural evidence for the supported MPSSE command subset only.

The Sipeed/BL702 adapter is a profile (plugins/ftdi/profiles); the rest of the
code is adapter-agnostic.
